  "skillName": "scheduled_order_fulfillment_monitor_notifier",
  "description": "Runs daily at 8pm to fetch eBay orders awaiting shipment, validate and fulfill (label + mark shipped), then email a consolidated run summary including tracking and any hold/failure reasons.",
