          "prompt": "Create an email-ready summary for this eBay fulfillment run.\nRequirements:\n- Include totals: fetched/processed/fulfilled/partial/on_hold/failed/skipped.\n- Include per-order bullet list: order_id, outcome, reason (if any), tracking numbers (if any).\n- Include a section \"Human intervention needed\" listing tool errors/ambiguous cases.\n- Be concise and scannable.\n\nInput JSON:\n{{{{run.summary_input}}}}",
